{"name":"The Return Key","slug":"glyph-return-key","blurb":"On the bind street, Hana carries the key toward the bracket lamp. The mark is Return. Click the key and it lights. A touch does not keep a step. A step away from the lamp is not kept. A step is kept only when the gap shrinks. The page proves its own street law on load. Glyph: The Return Key.","seal":"0b710abe307df7bdf55d8f56f825b2f099e1bfc9b2fe6237e882fb28ada79d46"}
